ntial to revolutionize vast swaths of our economy: the blockchain.\nIn The Truth Machine, Michael J. Casey and Paul Vigna demystify the blockchain and explain why it can restore personal control over our data, assets, and identities; grant billions of excluded people access to the global economy; and shift the balance of power to revive society’s faith in itself. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Truth Machine (https://us.macmillan.com/books/9781250304964/thetruthmachine/)\nciteturn115search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 8.6 years ago; Crawled: 4 weeks ago; Still, the institutions on both sides of that disruption story all feel compelled to engage in research and development in this field. ... Copyright © 2018 by Paul Vigna and Michael J. ... Macmillan Audio ... “The Truth Machine is a brilliant, beautifully written guide to the blockchain revolution that is redefining “trust” for our increasingly globalized world.” —Hernando de Soto, President of the Institute for Liberty and Democracy, author of The Mystery of Capital ... “In The Truth Machine, Casey and Vigna describe, in vivid detail, both the theory and practice of the coming block-chain revolution, giving us a powerful technological roadmap to a more participatory future in the digital age.” —Jeremy Rifkin, author of The Zero Marginal Cost Society\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Truth Machine - Macmillan Academic (https://academic.macmillan.com/academictrade/9781250304179/thetruthmachine/)\nciteturn115search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: 7.6 years ago; Crawled: last month; # The Truth Machine ... Casey and Paul Vigna ... The Truth Machine is the best book so far on what has happened and what may come along.... ... But it’s not just in developing countries, or in the realm of non-profit charity and development work, that blockchain technology shows potential. ... That’s because the blockchain is seen as ca